Open debugger from inspector: choose method and typed arguments, start paused.
Display running definition, highlighted statement, arguments, fields, result/signal.
Poll active frames without replacing edits while the pause revision is unchanged.
Step/continue/retry submit optional replacement and typed edits for the current frame.
Return supplies a typed result; abort works even if editor inputs are invalid.
Close stops polling; reopen reads the same session. Stale responses cannot replace
a different receiver's frame. The header reopens the last selected receiver.
